"access rules continue to flow through the gated /serve proxy. "
"<strong>Caveat:</strong> once a public URL is on the CDN edge, anyone who "
"has it can keep viewing — even after you flip the media to private. Leave "
"off if you need WordPress to re-validate privacy on every image request."
msgstr ""

